{
  "rules": [
    {
      "package": "openai",
      "old_api": "openai.api_key",
      "new_api": "client = OpenAI(api_key=os.environ['OPENAI_API_KEY'])",
      "requires_instantiation": true,
      "migration_type": "initialization",
      "description": "The initialization of the OpenAI client has changed. The old method of setting the API key is no longer supported.",
      "from_version": "0.28.1",
      "to_version": "v1.0.0",
      "example_before": null,
      "example_after": null,
      "evidence": "```py\n# old\nimport openai\n\nopenai.api_key = os.environ['OPENAI_API_KEY']\n\n# new\nfrom openai import OpenAI\n\nclient = OpenAI(\n  api_key=os.environ['OPENAI_API_KEY'],  # this is also the default, it can be omitted\n)\n```",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/openai/openai-python/discussions/742",
      "validation_status": "validated"
    },
    {
      "package": "openai",
      "old_api": "openai.Completion.create",
      "new_api": "client.completions.create",
      "requires_instantiation": true,
      "migration_type": "structural",
      "description": "The method for creating completions has changed. The old method is no longer supported.",
      "from_version": "0.28.1",
      "to_version": "v1.0.0",
      "example_before": null,
      "example_after": null,
      "evidence": "```py\n# before\nimport json\nimport openai\n\ncompletion = openai.Completion.create(model='curie')\nprint(completion['choices'][0]['text'])\nprint(completion.get('usage'))\nprint(json.dumps(completion, indent=2))\n\n# after\nfrom openai import OpenAI\n\nclient = OpenAI()\n\ncompletion = client.completions.create(model='curie')\nprint(completion.choices[0].text)\nprint(dict(completion).get('usage'))\nprint(completion.model_dump_json(indent=2))\n```",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/openai/openai-python/discussions/742",
      "validation_status": "validated"
    },
    {
      "package": "openai",
      "old_api": "openai.ChatCompletion.acreate",
      "new_api": "await client.chat.completions.create",
      "requires_instantiation": true,
      "migration_type": "structural",
      "description": "The method for creating chat completions has changed. The old method is no longer supported.",
      "from_version": "0.28.1",
      "to_version": "v1.0.0",
      "example_before": null,
      "example_after": null,
      "evidence": "```py\n# old\nimport openai\n\ncompletion = openai.ChatCompletion.acreate(model=\"gpt-3.5-turbo\", messages=[{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Hello world\"}])\n\n# new\nfrom openai import AsyncOpenAI\n\nclient = AsyncOpenAI()\ncompletion = await client.chat.completions.create(model=\"gpt-3.5-turbo\", messages=[{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Hello world\"}])\n```",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/openai/openai-python/discussions/742",
      "validation_status": "validated"
    },
